<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal cuts VAT on soft drinks.</title>
<headline>Portugal cuts VAT on soft drinks.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's cabinet approved a reduction in Value Added Tax on soft drinks and fruit juices to 12 percent from 17 percent, a statement released after the meeting said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
